{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Ultimate TTRPG 3D Map-Making Tool</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity with <strong>Master Of Realms</strong>, the revolutionary 3D Smart Hex Map Making Tool designed for tabletop RPG enthusiasts! Dive into immersive worldbuilding and craft <strong>world maps, regional maps, and city or town maps</strong> with ease. Master Of Realms lets you create stunning hex-based maps effortlessly, and you can bring them to life with <strong>3D printing</strong>, <strong>2D export for beautiful paper maps</strong>, or <strong>VTT export for your favorite online platforms</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/80eaec6f81db2a9b022dd76274bd0ec3.poster.avif?t=1767479811\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/80eaec6f81db2a9b022dd76274bd0ec3.webm?t=1767479811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/80eaec6f81db2a9b022dd76274bd0ec3.mp4?t=1767479811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br>1. 2D Export:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your creations to life on virtual tabletops! Export maps in <strong>2D formats</strong> like JPG, PNG, or VTT, with full support for <strong>FoundryVTT</strong> and other platforms. Customize your grid overlay in <strong>Hex or Square</strong> style to match your campaign needs.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/3f62fad21ac394040821c105130b3741.poster.avif?t=1767479811\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/3f62fad21ac394040821c105130b3741.webm?t=1767479811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/3f62fad21ac394040821c105130b3741.mp4?t=1767479811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2. 3D Export:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go beyond the map\u2014bring your realms to life in stunning 3D! Export fully detailed <strong>STL files</strong> for immersive gameplay, epic <strong>3D prints</strong>, or jaw-dropping displays that showcase your world like never before.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/daf829815ee44061b6c47cdcdbfc3df2.poster.avif?t=1767479811\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/daf829815ee44061b6c47cdcdbfc3df2.webm?t=1767479811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/daf829815ee44061b6c47cdcdbfc3df2.mp4?t=1767479811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3. Customize your tiles:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master of Realms gives you full flexibility to bring your imagination to life. Craft custom tiles from scratch, add objects of any shape, size, or style, and place them exactly where you want to create a world that\u2019s truly your own.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/18d091691aa84baf5d889cc5fb6c0b8c.poster.avif?t=1767479811\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/18d091691aa84baf5d889cc5fb6c0b8c.webm?t=1767479811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/18d091691aa84baf5d889cc5fb6c0b8c.mp4?t=1767479811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4. Character Tokens:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into your world through your heroes\u2019 eyes! Master of Realms introduces <strong>Character Tokens</strong> that let you explore your maps and scenes from a character\u2019s point of view. Scale your tokens up or down to match any setting\u2014perfect for tactical encounters or immersive storytelling. Plus, bring your characters to life in the real world with <strong>3D-printable tokens</strong>, fully compatible with the 3D export system for STL files.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/74a3cc060767f868b1182167e0ac07d7.poster.avif?t=1767479811\" width=800 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/74a3cc060767f868b1182167e0ac07d7.webm?t=1767479811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/74a3cc060767f868b1182167e0ac07d7.mp4?t=1767479811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5. Unparalleled Map-Making Power:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a hex tile and start drawing on the grid, and watch as Master Of Realms transforms your vision into a breathtaking 3D map. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5. Streamlined User Experience:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tSave your progress effortlessly with the File Save System.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tDive into map creation on your PC or Mac.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tStay organized with in-app user authentication and activation (coming soon). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tEnhance your toolkit with in-app purchases (coming soon). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6. Community and Support:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tJoin a vibrant community of TTRPG map makers and get inspired by their creations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tAccess comprehensive support resources to help you unleash your full map-making potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to become the ultimate Game Master with Master Of Realms! Create, share, and immerse yourself in epic RPG adventures like never before. Your tabletop world awaits \u2013 bring it to life with Master Of Realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Note: Master Of Realms is currently in development, with features actively being implemented and optimized. Stay tuned for exciting updates!)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2295940?t=1767479811","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2295940?t=1767479811","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/1f6c878248fbce18c748b5455d950a6e39bd60f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767479811","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/1f6c878248fbce18c748b5455d950a6e39bd60f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767479811","categories":[{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Turn Notifications","id":32}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Ultimate TTRPG 3D Map-Making Tool</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity with <strong>Master Of Realms</strong>, the revolutionary 3D Smart Hex Map Making Tool designed for tabletop RPG enthusiasts! Dive into immersive worldbuilding and craft <strong>world maps, regional maps, and city or town maps</strong> with ease. Master Of Realms lets you create stunning hex-based maps effortlessly, and you can bring them to life with <strong>3D printing</strong>, <strong>2D export for beautiful paper maps</strong>, or <strong>VTT export for your favorite online platforms</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/80eaec6f81db2a9b022dd76274bd0ec3.poster.avif?t=1767479811\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/80eaec6f81db2a9b022dd76274bd0ec3.webm?t=1767479811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/80eaec6f81db2a9b022dd76274bd0ec3.mp4?t=1767479811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br>1. 2D Export:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your creations to life on virtual tabletops! Export maps in <strong>2D formats</strong> like JPG, PNG, or VTT, with full support for <strong>FoundryVTT</strong> and other platforms. Customize your grid overlay in <strong>Hex or Square</strong> style to match your campaign needs.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/3f62fad21ac394040821c105130b3741.poster.avif?t=1767479811\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/3f62fad21ac394040821c105130b3741.webm?t=1767479811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/3f62fad21ac394040821c105130b3741.mp4?t=1767479811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2. 3D Export:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go beyond the map\u2014bring your realms to life in stunning 3D! Export fully detailed <strong>STL files</strong> for immersive gameplay, epic <strong>3D prints</strong>, or jaw-dropping displays that showcase your world like never before.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/daf829815ee44061b6c47cdcdbfc3df2.poster.avif?t=1767479811\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/daf829815ee44061b6c47cdcdbfc3df2.webm?t=1767479811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/daf829815ee44061b6c47cdcdbfc3df2.mp4?t=1767479811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3. Customize your tiles:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master of Realms gives you full flexibility to bring your imagination to life. Craft custom tiles from scratch, add objects of any shape, size, or style, and place them exactly where you want to create a world that\u2019s truly your own.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/18d091691aa84baf5d889cc5fb6c0b8c.poster.avif?t=1767479811\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/18d091691aa84baf5d889cc5fb6c0b8c.webm?t=1767479811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/18d091691aa84baf5d889cc5fb6c0b8c.mp4?t=1767479811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4. Character Tokens:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into your world through your heroes\u2019 eyes! Master of Realms introduces <strong>Character Tokens</strong> that let you explore your maps and scenes from a character\u2019s point of view. Scale your tokens up or down to match any setting\u2014perfect for tactical encounters or immersive storytelling. Plus, bring your characters to life in the real world with <strong>3D-printable tokens</strong>, fully compatible with the 3D export system for STL files.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/74a3cc060767f868b1182167e0ac07d7.poster.avif?t=1767479811\" width=800 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/74a3cc060767f868b1182167e0ac07d7.webm?t=1767479811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/extras/74a3cc060767f868b1182167e0ac07d7.mp4?t=1767479811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5. Unparalleled Map-Making Power:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a hex tile and start drawing on the grid, and watch as Master Of Realms transforms your vision into a breathtaking 3D map. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5. Streamlined User Experience:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tSave your progress effortlessly with the File Save System.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tDive into map creation on your PC or Mac.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tStay organized with in-app user authentication and activation (coming soon). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tEnhance your toolkit with in-app purchases (coming soon). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6. Community and Support:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tJoin a vibrant community of TTRPG map makers and get inspired by their creations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tAccess comprehensive support resources to help you unleash your full map-making potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to become the ultimate Game Master with Master Of Realms! Create, share, and immerse yourself in epic RPG adventures like never before. Your tabletop world awaits \u2013 bring it to life with Master Of Realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Note: Master Of Realms is currently in development, with features actively being implemented and optimized. Stay tuned for exciting updates!)</p>","developers":["TheMasterForge LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Design & Illustration","id":"53"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295940/d7c03b2464bf735d69214a07b6a4b332014caf1f/header.jpg?t=1767479811","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Master of Realms","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5 5th Generation<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> You can run the application smoothly on medium graphic settings.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5 9th Generation<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> You can run the application with high-quality settings for an optimal experience.</li></ul>"},